From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:48:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/37] s13d g4 cont4: left outward shift as one pinned segment

The left layout's fields (zr_lfield, zr_lstart) and their word lemma; the left
outward shift on the zoned tape (zr_shiftOut_tape) and both guards' disabled
cases (zr_shiftIn_off, zr_shiftOut_off). The left outward shift at level i is
one segment of forty catalog leaves: the outer and inner columns on scratch,
two cuts, the outer zone written in two parts, the inner zone's outer half
cleared, the scratch cleared (zr_outA3 for tape 0's endpoint). The pinned
walk now takes its ruler from either tape.

